Krita Brush Engine Extraction — NOTICE & ATTRIBUTION
=====================================================

This package contains source code and resources extracted from the
Krita digital painting application, specifically the brush engine,
brush presets, brush tips, and the minimum supporting libraries.

Upstream project:  Krita — https://krita.org/
Upstream source:   https://github.com/KDE/krita (official KDE mirror)
                  https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita
Extracted from:    master branch (shallow clone, depth=1)
                  (equivalent to a recent 5.x / 6.x release state)

Copyright (C) The Krita Authors. See the SPDX-FileCopyrightText headers
in each individual source file for the specific contributors and years.

